--- a/repo/generators/4043070e87c0/notes.md
+++ b/repo/generators/4043070e87c0/notes.md
@@ -2,3 +2,31 @@
 
 Record design decisions, hypotheses, review findings, and unresolved questions here.
 Imported associated notes retain original evidence/timestamps in `evidence/associated_notes.jsonl`.
+
+## Current bounded learnability finding
+
+Reproduced against generator SHA-256
+`5d7c3ee577d0f7b86d2d09df22d6d32e790fb7ab79fe283c717d62e07ef48b3c`:
+the plausible rival “mark top-half zeros red and ignore the bottom panel”
+fits both demonstrations in the supported explicit two-demo request at seed 0,
+sample index 0, with no overrides, but differs from the first query at zero-based
+cells `(0, 5)` and `(0, 6)`. Canonical Racket returns 0 there; the Racket rival
+returns 2. All four generated inputs in the retained two-demo/two-query episode
+pass `self_check` and the public API records no rejections.
+
+An authored three-demo view using the same unmodified pairs at sample indices
+`[0, 1, 3]`, with query index `2`, also leaves this rival undefeated. This is a
+deliberate rearrangement, **not** a default sequential three-demo episode.
+This source declares no example minimum or lesson identifiability checks; the
+public API's automatic floor is three, and an explicit request for two is
+supported. The bounded search over seeds 0–7 found no default sequential
+three-demo witness for this one rival. No frequency or exhaustive claim follows.
+
+The source-bound reproducer is [workspace/learnability_probe.py](workspace/learnability_probe.py).
+Its [witness](workspace/learnability_witness.json) retains the exact canonical and
+rival programs, protected Racket labels, generated inputs, predictions, policy,
+source hashes, and rerun command. Proposed mitigation: ensure demonstrations
+distinguish each panel-only rival, or reject materialized lessons when such a
+rival fits every demonstration but disagrees on a query. The finding is
+reproduced; the mitigation remains unimplemented. No generator, rule, approval,
+or shared authority was changed.
